chapter AFP

session Grounding_Temporal_Base = Grounding_Base +
  description \<open>Thin layer loading the Formal-PDDL-Semantics temporal PDDL semantics on top of the
    Analysis-free Grounding_Base heap. It loads the DISCRETE temporal semantics
    (Temporal_Planning_Discrete), which is free of the HOL-Analysis / ODE tower -- so the whole
    temporal grounding tree stays Analysis-free. The continuous ODE checker
    (Temporal_Planning.Temporal_PDDL_Checker_Numeric) is deliberately NOT loaded: the grounder is
    grounding-only and reasons about plan validity through the discrete valid_temp_plan2, never the
    checker. SAT-free and graph-free. No project-local theories.\<close>
  sessions
    "Temporal_Planning_Discrete"
  theories [document = false]
    "Temporal_Planning_Discrete.Temporal_Happening_Semantics"
    "Temporal_Planning_Discrete.Temporal_State_Sequence_Semantics"
